    "created_at": "2026-10-01T21:54:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-01T21:54:43Z",
    "body": "Current Blink exposes an interesting consistency problem here.\n\n`USBDevice::reset()` forwards the reset to the device, but `AsyncReset()` only clears `device_state_change_in_progress_`; it does not refresh `configuration_index_`, claimed interfaces, selected alternates, or endpoint availability.\n\nSo if reset changes configuration state at the platform/device layer, the JS object's cached state can become stale.\n\nThis looks closely related to #258 and seems testable with the same stale-configuration harness.\n",
